{"request":{"path":"/rest/contents/search","query":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"projection":"full","sort":"viewsCount:desc"},"body":{"operator":"and","filters":{"format":{"includes":["video"]},"publishedAt":{"after":"2026-06-27","before":"2026-09-27"}},"queries":[{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["restaurant","restaurants"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["dubai"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["how to","tutorial","step by step"],"operator":"or"}},"transcript":{"includesExactly":{"values":["how to","tutorial","step by step"],"operator":"or"}}}}]}},"status":200,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-27T10:25:47.959Z","response":{"data":{"aggregations":{"totalViewsCount":1276367,"totalInteractionsCount":7148,"totalEngagementRatePerViews":0.005600270141738231,"totalEngagementRatePerFollowers":0.0017772804972804974},"results":[{"id":"cnt_2367293f4b18bae251c5ef942680","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"tiktok","profileHandle":"dens_destinations","profileDisplayName":"dens_destinations","format":"video","caption":"Have you ever thought about turning a layover in Dubai into a trip of its own? ✈️🌴 ad Even with just 24 hours, you can experience so many different sides of the city - from the beach and incredible restaurants to iconic landmarks, shopping and even the desert. It's one of those places that's surprisingly easy to explore in a short amount of time, making it the perfect stopover destination. So next time you're booking a long-haul flight, see if you can add a stop in Dubai along the way. Would you do a Dubai stopover? 👇 @Visit Dubai #VisitDubai #Dubai #DubaiTravel #travel #thingstodoindubai ","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_d102fe48da331a11bc8bc5dfc736","publishedAt":"2026-08-10T16:11:45.000Z","profileId":"prf_a398791519aa2690673c74789ab4","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":558900,"likesCount":399,"sharesCount":49,"commentsCount":7,"interactionsCount":455,"engagementRatePerViews":0.08140991232778673,"engagementRatePerFollowers":0.8394833948339484,"profileFollowersCount":54200,"profileFollowingCount":322,"profilePostsCount":921,"mediaCount":1,"duration":50,"hashtags":["#visitdubai","#dubai","#dubaitravel","#travel","#thingstodoindubai"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[{"id":"prf_2fce3878df84923b35f0bfcd1fc4","platformId":"6938274541602014209","profileHandle":"visitdubai"}],"platformId":"7672436358493015319","profilePlatformId":"6760708401473405958","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/dens_destinations/pfp.webp","profileBio":"London based but always elsewhere\nEmma.denley.12@hotmail.co.uk","profileVerified":false,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"Have you ever thought about turning a stopover in Dubai into a trip of its own? Instead of staying at the airport, here's how to spend just one day exploring the city. Start with breakfast at Tasha's before heading to the huge Dubai Mall to browse the shops or visit the aquarium, and of course, stop to see the Burj Khalifa at the world's tallest building. Then, it's lunch with incredible views at High Society, followed by an afternoon exploring Dubai Marina and walking along the picturesque Kite Beach. And if you've got a few extra hours, head into the desert for some adrenaline-fueled quad biking and sandboarding too. Finish the day with an incredible sunset dinner at Shimmers before heading back to the airport to catch your connecting flights. And the best part, just how easy it is to get around, whether you hop on the metro, grab a taxi, or use Kareem to get between areas. So you can experience beaches, world-class dining, shopping, and even the desert all in a single stopover. Whether you're looking for adventure, incredible food, or a chance to unwind, there really is an itinerary for every kind of traveler. So next time you're flying through Dubai, don't just pass through, make the most of your stopover with a trip into the city.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.075,"endSeconds":3.075,"text":"Have you ever thought about turning a stopover in Dubai into a trip of its own?"},{"startSeconds":3.135,"endSeconds":6.395,"text":"Instead of staying at the airport, here's how to spend just one day exploring the city."},{"startSeconds":6.515,"endSeconds":10.795,"text":"Start with breakfast at Tasha's before heading to the huge Dubai Mall to browse the shops or visit the aquarium,"},{"startSeconds":10.975,"endSeconds":13.795,"text":"and of course, stop to see the Burj Khalifa at the world's tallest building."},{"startSeconds":13.915,"endSeconds":16.075,"text":"Then, it's lunch with incredible views at High Society,"},{"startSeconds":16.295,"endSeconds":20.155,"text":"followed by an afternoon exploring Dubai Marina and walking along the picturesque Kite Beach."},{"startSeconds":20.275,"endSeconds":24.615,"text":"And if you've got a few extra hours, head into the desert for some adrenaline-fueled quad biking and sandboarding too."},{"startSeconds":24.735,"endSeconds":29.175,"text":"Finish the day with an incredible sunset dinner at Shimmers before heading back to the airport to catch your connecting flights."},{"startSeconds":29.175,"endSeconds":34.975,"text":"And the best part, just how easy it is to get around, whether you hop on the metro, grab a taxi, or use Kareem to get between areas."},{"startSeconds":35.055,"endSeconds":39.695,"text":"So you can experience beaches, world-class dining, shopping, and even the desert all in a single stopover."},{"startSeconds":39.815,"endSeconds":45.075,"text":"Whether you're looking for adventure, incredible food, or a chance to unwind, there really is an itinerary for every kind of traveler."},{"startSeconds":45.215,"endSeconds":49.795,"text":"So next time you're flying through Dubai, don't just pass through, make the most of your stopover with a trip into the city."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_8f79946ed5849b74d60edf77eb7f","position":1,"timestampSeconds":0.27,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/1_0.27.webp"},{"id":"med_6fd48b75e5f689f3d3cff11989c3","position":2,"timestampSeconds":0.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/2_0.50.webp"},{"id":"med_de3f1a49c4b6b68d7f549aad3bb1","position":3,"timestampSeconds":0.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/3_0.77.webp"},{"id":"med_d1d94efd7fd6e73762bbd5d1a495","position":4,"timestampSeconds":1.03,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/4_1.03.webp"},{"id":"med_dcff9d6ff0af0ed2f4c7889d4cf6","position":5,"timestampSeconds":1.27,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/5_1.27.webp"},{"id":"med_838a90f9d219e9e484c0d9fe26e0","position":6,"timestampSeconds":1.53,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/6_1.53.webp"},{"id":"med_8159816521bab09de130c0cea043","position":7,"timestampSeconds":1.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/7_1.77.webp"},{"id":"med_d1243cd4546f9fddaaaee574f917","position":8,"timestampSeconds":2.27,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/8_2.27.webp"},{"id":"med_4e3accb8fdd701f498bd053ef4d7","position":9,"timestampSeconds":2.53,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7672436358493015319/9_2.53.webp"},{"id":"med_05e606d6c7446c4026e6a3e79f51","position":10,"timestampSeconds":2.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/76724